>> Animal := Obyekt yangi.
>> Factory := Obyekt yangi.

Animal kelganda: ['yangi'] bajar: {
	>> animal := oʻzi yangi.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal kelganda: ['sound:'] bajar: { :s
	oʻzining sound := s.
}.

Animal kelganda: ['sound'] bajar: { <- oʻzining sound.
}.

>> Dog := Obyekt yangi.
>> Cat := Obyekt yangi.

Dog kelganda: ['yangi'] bajar: { <- Animal yangi sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat kelganda: ['yangi'] bajar: { <- Animal yangi sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Chiqish yozish: Dog yangi sound, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: Cat yangi sound, yangi-qator.

Factory kelganda: ['mix:and:'] bajar: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal yangi sound: (
		( beast1 sound boshlab: 0 uzunlik: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound boshlab: 2 uzunlik: 5 )
	).
}.

Chiqish yozish: (Factory mix: Dog yangi and: Cat yangi) sound, yangi-qator.
